## Testing Strategy

### PestPHP Feature Tests (tests/Feature/)

- Test all CRUD endpoints (index, show, store, update, destroy)
- Test authentication requirements
- Test authorization (policy checks)
- Test validation rules (valid and invalid data)
- Test Inertia responses (component, props)
- Test database changes (assertDatabaseHas)

### PestPHP Unit Tests (tests/Unit/)

- Test service methods in isolation
- Test repository methods
- Test model relationships
- Mock external dependencies

### E2E Tests with Playwright (tests/Browser/)

- Test complete user workflows
- Test form submissions with validation errors
- Test pagination and filtering
- Test authorization (different user roles)

